# SvgCanvas.ascii
# Interactive SVG drawing canvas with pan/zoom, drawing, selection, and resize

+----------------------------------------------------------+
| [viewport background: #e5e7eb, fills visible area]       |
|                                                          |
|  +--------------------------------------------+         |
|  | [canvas: white, sourceWidth x sourceHeight] |         |
|  |                                             |         |
|  |  [#art-layer]                               |         |
|  |    <path .selected? />...                   |         |
|  |                                             |         |
|  |  [#bubbles-layer]                           |         |
|  |    <rect rounded /> + <path tail /> +       |         |
|  |    <rect seam-cover />...                   |         |
|  |                                             |         |
|  |  [#text-layer]                              |         |
|  |    <text bubble-text />...                  |         |
|  |    <text standalone .selected? />...        |         |
|  |    <foreignObject text-input />             |         |
|  |                                             |         |
|  |  [drawing-preview: opacity=0.5]             |         |
|  |    <path current-stroke />                  |         |
|  |                                             |         |
|  |  [marquee-rect: dashed indigo]              |         |
|  |    +-  -  -  -  -+                          |         |
|  |    |              |                          |         |
|  |    +-  -  -  -  -+                          |         |
|  |                                             |         |
|  |  [selection-bounding-box: dashed indigo]    |         |
|  |    +- - - - - - -+                          |         |
|  |    |              |                          |         |
|  |    +- - - - - - -+                          |         |
|  |                                             |         |
|  |  [corner-handles: 4x white squares]         |         |
|  |    [nw]            [ne]                     |         |
|  |                                             |         |
|  |    [sw]            [se]                     |         |
|  |                                             |         |
|  +--------------------------------------------+         |
|                                                          |
+----------------------------------------------------------+

## Element Table

| ascii              | type         | attrs / notes                                      | region  | cond                             |
|--------------------|--------------|---------------------------------------------------|---------|---------------------------------|
| viewport bg        | rect         | fill=#e5e7eb, covers viewBox                      | root    | always                          |
| canvas             | rect         | white fill, stroke=#d1d5db                        | root    | always                          |
| path               | path         | per PathData, .selected highlight                 | art     | v-show layerVisibility.art      |
| bubble group       | g > rect+path+rect | rounded rect + tail path + seam cover rect | bubbles | v-show layerVisibility.bubbles  |
| bubble text        | text         | centered in bubble rect                           | text    | v-show layerVisibility.text     |
| standalone text    | text / foreignObject | inline editing via foreignObject          | text    | v-show layerVisibility.text     |
| drawing preview    | path         | opacity=0.5, current stroke                      | overlay | isDrawing && currentPathD       |
| marquee rect       | rect         | dashed indigo fill+stroke                         | overlay | isMarqueeActive && has size     |
| bounding box       | rect         | dashed indigo stroke, no fill, pointer-events=none| overlay | selectionBounds non-null        |
| corner handles     | rect x4      | white fill, indigo stroke, constant screen size   | overlay | selectionBounds non-null        |

## States

| state     | cursor        | trigger                              |
|-----------|---------------|--------------------------------------|
| idle      | default/tool  | no interaction                       |
| panning   | grabbing      | middle-click / space+drag / 2-finger |
| drawing   | crosshair     | draw tool + mousedown                |
| dragging  | grabbing      | select tool + element mousedown      |
| marquee   | crosshair     | select tool + canvas mousedown       |
| resizing  | nwse/nesw     | corner handle mousedown              |
| text-edit | text          | text tool + click / dblclick         |
